  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/66/emo_embarrassed-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "あはは。歌ってる姿が綺麗だったから、見とれちゃったって？　やぁん、なぜか見知らぬ男の子に口説かれちゃってる～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "面白い子ね、あなた。あんまり見かけない顔だけれど、新入りさん？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "もしかして、迷子になっちゃったのかしら。『綺麗』って褒めてくれたお礼に、目的の場所まで案内してあげてもいいけれど～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "うん。あたし、長期入院ちゅうで……。この病院のことは、お医者さんより詳しいの。あんまり、威張れないことだけれど。あぁ、早く退院したい～♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "……ふぅん。あなたが、噂の『転校生くん』なの？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "pajamas_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/66/habit-4.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "うん。あたしも同じ君咲学院の生徒で、三年Ｃ組の曽根セイラっていうの。いちおう軽音部の部長～、よろしくね♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "んん。お見舞いにきてくれるお友達とかがね、よく君咲学院のことを教えてくれるの。あなた、ずいぶん噂になってるから知っていたのだけれど"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "pajamas_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -8,
      "y": 464
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "セイラ",
    "text": "君咲学院、ほとんど女子校なのに……。男の子ひとりじゃ、大変でしょ。慣れない環境で体調を崩して、病院に診察を受けにきた感じかしら？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 66,
    "dress": "pajamas",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "pajamas_expression/joyful",
